Homepage: https://github.com/hifiberry/jellyfin-wrapper

Package: hifiberry-jellyfin
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${venv:Python},
 python3-gi, gir1.2-glib-2.0, python3-pil, libmpv2
Description: Jellyfin cast target for HiFiBerryOS
 Makes the device a playback target for Jellyfin: cast music, movies and
 series to it from any Jellyfin app. Audio plays through the normal
 HiFiBerryOS audio path; video plays full-screen on HDMI when a display is
 connected.
 .
 Runs jellyfin-mpv-shim, which is included in this package together with
 the Python libraries it needs.
